<mxfile host="Electron" pages="4">
  <diagram id="5ML3OHMtcv44sEJqLFYa" name="caption">
    <mxGraphModel dx="808" dy="454" grid="1" gridSize="2" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="966" pageHeight="300" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="w1rlbFqt1l_fD-IMcbMO-1" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Georgia;fontSize=9;" value="Figure1: A full-duplex session advances in periodic micro-turns. The k-th micro-turn begins at d_k and is due by d_{k+1} = d_k + T. Within it, the model encodes the audio received over the previous period, prefills the resulting input tokens, and decodes a bounded output segment for playback; the GPU then idles until the next deadline. Input and output tokens are appended to the session&#39;s KV history, which remains resident on the GPU across periods. Decoding work per period is bounded by the chunk length and the output budget, whereas resident KV grows with every period; across concurrent sessions, GPU memory is exhausted long before compute is saturated." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="73" width="554" x="52" y="16" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
